Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.64,0:00:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will resurrect to the\Ngiant Ko instruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.55,0:00:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wind's not open, it's\Nalso chitinous chitin,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.28,0:00:19.33,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.33,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.30,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.18,0:00:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.98,0:00:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.75,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.83,0:01:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.75,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.43,0:01:21.56,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.28,0:01:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you believe Oikawa used\Nto be my dad's best friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.42,0:01:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.33,0:01:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandpa knew Armadimon\Nwas a Digimon because Dad
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.32,0:01:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Oikawa had seen the\NDigital World years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.46,0:01:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Owakawa's desperate to\Ngo to the Digi-World,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.32,0:01:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and somehow he's planning to use\Nthe Dark Blooms to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.20,0:01:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandpa tried to convince\NOwakawa to be good again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.68,0:01:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then Black War Greymon showed up to fight\Nwith Owakawa and was hurt pretty badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before he was completely reconfigured,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.76,0:01:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black War Greymon sacrificed\Nhimself to seal the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.52,0:01:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was horrible, and it was wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.38,0:02:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told him he had a heart.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.56,0:02:09.98,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fscx120\fscy120\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(316,322)}Terror! BelialVamdemon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.22,0:02:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this is supposed\Nto be the meeting place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.24,0:02:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but no one's even here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.98,0:02:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, look, there's one of them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.52,0:02:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's another one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.16,0:02:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They seem to be waiting for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think they're waiting for Oikawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.36,0:02:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that's why they're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.98,0:02:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.12,0:02:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe this will be our\Nchance to capture him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.42,0:02:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, wait a minute, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's not rush into anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why are they at Hikarigaoka?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A gate to the digital world has been\Nopened in this location many times before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.74,0:02:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.65,0:02:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why they're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.57,0:02:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But according to what\NGabumon and the others said,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black War Greymon completely\Nsealed the gate between the worlds,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.22,0:02:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unless those children don't know that yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.50,0:02:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then Oikawa doesn't either.\NHey, TK! Shh! Big Mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.62,0:02:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know where Tainzora are?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.32,0:02:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're keeping an eye on that girl from
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.04,0:02:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yesterday to make sure\Nnothing happens to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.12,0:02:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be very quiet, Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.68,0:02:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let him know we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.12,0:03:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am being very quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.34,0:03:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're not being very invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.10,0:03:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being a spy would be easier if we\Ndidn't have to do so much spying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.18,0:03:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does it bother you that Sora's\Nwith Tai instead of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.86,0:03:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.77,0:03:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ty's my best friend,\Nand he knows how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.74,0:03:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I completely trust Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.56,0:03:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried at all, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.26,0:03:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.17,0:03:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Izzy, honey. It's Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.08,0:03:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm down at Highton View Terrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.28,0:03:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.32,0:03:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking about\Nthe fact that all the other
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.36,0:03:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,parents are doing their part\Nto help out all of you kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.22,0:03:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, each one lending\Ntheir own expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.62,0:03:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I sat right down and asked\Nmyself, now what's my expertise?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.60,0:03:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the answer is snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.80,0:03:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I made you guys some PB\N&J with the crust cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.38,0:03:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,PB &J?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.70,0:03:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Mom, I know how you hate the crusts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.96,0:03:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.62,0:03:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be down in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.76,0:03:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.98,0:03:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.00,0:04:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.66,0:04:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,PB and Jack! Yeah-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.78,0:04:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that\Neverything about the digital
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.46,0:04:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world just seems to be\Ngetting worse and worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.98,0:04:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.89,0:04:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we don't have any idea of what\NOikawa's planning or what that shadow
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.50,0:04:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that came out of him was or even if\Nhe's more than an ordinary human.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.54,0:04:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if there's really anything\Nwe can do to save all those children.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.96,0:04:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.14,0:04:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we've just got to believe\Nin ourselves and keep trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.78,0:04:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.32,0:04:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.26,0:04:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm just feeling nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wish we knew what\NOikawa was planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.54,0:04:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time for harvesting has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.66,0:04:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.66,0:04:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.14,0:04:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's those pesky kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.78,0:04:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're guarding them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.80,0:04:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.71,0:04:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.20,0:04:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.64,0:04:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.55,0:04:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I felt something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it Oikawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.06,0:04:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe my mind was playing tricks on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.80,0:04:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.18,0:04:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I hope so, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:05:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think they noticed us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.82,0:05:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if they did notice\Nus, then it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.44,0:05:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? It's over?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.82,0:05:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over for them, not over for\Nus. Oh, right. Over for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.30,0:05:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.86,0:05:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you'll get it all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.66,0:05:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.58,0:05:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are we still talking\Nabout the same thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.12,0:05:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, hello there, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.16,0:05:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I brought you all some PB\N&J with a crust cutoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.54,0:05:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, you didn't need to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.24,0:05:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.15,0:05:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.07,0:05:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but you better go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.66,0:05:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't I stay for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.28,0:05:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Mom, things might get really ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.64,0:05:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then, I better go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.08,0:05:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So go, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.10,0:05:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please try to understand\NIzzy's feelings, Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.60,0:05:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.51,0:05:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really very important to him, and\Nhe doesn't want anything to happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.80,0:05:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, it's just that those children...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.68,0:05:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that their\Nparents would be worried
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about them if they knew\Nwhat their kids are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't need me here, I\Ncan go talk to their parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can get their\Nfolks to come down here and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.54,0:05:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see for themselves just what\Ntheir children are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.04,0:06:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's a great idea there, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.20,0:06:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.11,0:06:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.06,0:06:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get going then!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.90,0:06:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, everybody. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.30,0:06:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye, Susumu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.66,0:06:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if bringing their\Nparents here is going to help, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I doubt that even\Ntheir parents will be
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.50,0:06:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,able to remove the dark\Nspores from inside them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.96,0:06:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up hope, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.12,0:06:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe the parents can reach their\Nkids in a way that we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.74,0:06:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just the way Kari was able to reach me\Nwhen I was working for Mayota's man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.46,0:06:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.94,0:06:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.85,0:06:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.77,0:06:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, look at how you guys were\Nable to help turn me away from evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.10,0:06:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can be saved, they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.44,0:06:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.35,0:06:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as for the parents trying to help out,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.26,0:06:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no doubt in my mind that\Nthey will make a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.95,0:06:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe that part of the reason the dark
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.86,0:06:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spore stopped growing\Ninside of me is because I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.10,0:06:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was finally able to\Naccept the love my parents
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.26,0:06:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had been trying to give\Nme all those years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.60,0:06:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, something is happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.52,0:07:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oikawa, let's go get that creepy dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.41,0:07:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.96,0:07:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.88,0:07:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd better not touch those children!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.38,0:07:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, the roots of the dark\Nflowers are spreading like wildfire,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.22,0:07:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and if they're not removed before\Nthe growth cycle is complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.90,0:07:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all of these children\Nwill turn into dark trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.18,0:07:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he serious? I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.26,0:07:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what happened with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.68,0:07:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But can we really afford\Nto take the chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.10,0:07:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your spore was the original,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.68,0:07:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it was able to live inside\Nyou without destroying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.50,0:07:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the dark spores in these\Nchildren are only copies of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.98,0:07:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they're imperfect, and it seems\Nthat they're completely taking over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.26,0:07:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.02,0:07:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They wanted the spores. Ask them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.20,0:07:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.40,0:07:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.88,0:07:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.54,0:07:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're on our way to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.76,0:07:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bandage Brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.80,0:07:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just because we're doing that\Ndoesn't mean you have to tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.22,0:07:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.66,0:07:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone, Arokanymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter that they know, because\Nthere's nothing they can do to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.88,0:07:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.84,0:08:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.72,0:08:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, really,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.63,0:08:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've successfully sent\NArchnemon and Mummymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from here to the digital\Nworld many times before,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.40,0:08:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,haven't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.31,0:08:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a weak spot between the two worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.92,0:08:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now the dark spores\Nwill open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.64,0:08:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's the gate\Nthat Blackwell Grayma...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.96,0:08:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shh, Big Mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the gate doesn't open,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.72,0:08:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oikawa will be distracted and that may\Ngive us the chance to save those children.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.58,0:08:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.50,0:08:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this is your last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything you've always wanted to ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.62,0:08:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.66,0:08:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you have to pick me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.40,0:08:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, not this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.16,0:08:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always knew that you were Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.30,0:08:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I knew that you were\Nthe most vulnerable one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.94,0:08:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Overwhelmed by darkness yourself,\Nyou were the perfect tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.82,0:08:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are the Dark Towers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.50,0:08:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A present from the dark\Nocean to keep you busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.14,0:08:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They proved to be quite fortuitous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I suppose you want\Nto know their purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.18,0:08:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, they were to change the\Nborders of the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.00,0:08:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just what did you hope to\Naccomplish by changing the borders?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.28,0:08:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's simple, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.50,0:09:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I wanted to weaken\Nthe digital world's defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.30,0:09:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.84,0:09:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could always open a gate to the digital\Nworld, But there was one little problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.94,0:09:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its defenses always\Nprevented me from entering.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I created these two by\Nturning my DNA into data
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and sent them into the\Ndigital world in my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.88,0:09:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when I saw them there, it\Nonly made me want to go more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.92,0:09:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I used you to build\Nthe control spires, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.16,0:09:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But all you other kids ruined that plan,\Nso I had to come up with another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.84,0:09:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I couldn't alter the barrier between\Nthe worlds from inside the digital world,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.80,0:09:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd do it from inside the real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.74,0:09:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's when I came up with\Nthe idea for the dark spores.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.48,0:09:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each of them feeding on the innocence\Nthat enables a child to enter the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.06,0:09:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digital world and converting it to\Nthe power I needed to go there myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.90,0:09:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only dream, my lifelong\Ngoal, is almost within my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.80,0:09:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to these deluded children\NI've waited so long for this
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.02,0:09:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why's he crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.52,0:09:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the matter boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.56,0:10:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dream is finally\Ncoming true Oh, Hiroki,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.02,0:10:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how I wish I could have\Nbrought you with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.32,0:10:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, my little children, all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.02,0:10:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boys and girls, boys and girls,\Nlet's go to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.30,0:10:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boys and girls, boys and girls,\Nlet's go to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.30,0:10:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boys and girls, boys and girls,\Nlet's go to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.94,0:10:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying to open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.42,0:10:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,OK, get ready to jump him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.22,0:10:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll find out soon enough that Ring
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.98,0:10:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rod and Rosie won't get\Nhim to the Digi World.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.46,0:10:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.52,0:10:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That song is pretty catchy.\NAha! This is it. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.24,0:10:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The long wait is over at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It opened!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.68,0:10:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it actually worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.44,0:10:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Children, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.82,0:10:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't leave us behind. Wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.68,0:10:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did he open up the gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.54,0:10:56.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.45,0:10:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.96,0:10:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save the world as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.02,0:11:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.93,0:11:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't just rush after him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.22,0:11:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.78,0:11:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.76,0:11:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.82,0:11:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all on their own now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.24,0:11:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here! We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.18,0:11:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The digital world is here! We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.62,0:11:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have arrived, children!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are finally here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.28,0:11:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's real!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.30,0:11:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've spent so much time\Ndreaming about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.02,0:11:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that finally being here\Nmakes it seem as if I've
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.64,0:11:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only fallen asleep and\Nreturned to that dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.56,0:11:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's real!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.47,0:11:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dream is real!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment I've been\Nwaiting for is finally here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.84,0:11:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.34,0:11:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.24,0:11:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.50,0:12:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you play with\Nthe other children?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.34,0:12:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.66,0:12:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not really in the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.72,0:12:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.06,0:12:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it's the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.98,0:12:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's, it's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.66,0:12:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, wha, what is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.70,0:12:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this isn't the digital world,\Nthen where have I brought us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.72,0:12:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Acid Mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.22,0:12:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The... Razor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.02,0:12:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.26,0:12:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was just a sample\Nof your parting gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.10,0:12:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, now let those children go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.00,0:12:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.12,0:12:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.54,0:12:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happened to my dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.04,0:12:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because Black War Greymon\Nshut the digital gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.14,0:12:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we must have ricocheted to another world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But which world this\Nmight be, I have no clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.44,0:12:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.94,0:12:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.36,0:12:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to go to the digital world!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.94,0:13:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't always get\Nwhat you want, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.26,0:13:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I call a big mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.42,0:13:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can forget the digital world, Oikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.32,0:13:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is beyond your reach now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.90,0:13:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will never see it\Nagain, even in your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, cry. You are doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.38,0:13:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For you have entered a world of despair
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.70,0:13:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where your souls will\Nbe consumed by darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.78,0:13:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and there is no place for you to\Nhide nor hope for you to escape
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.78,0:13:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who or what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.50,0:13:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you working with Daemon\Nor some other weirdo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.38,0:13:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daemon? Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.56,0:13:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I going crazy or is my\Nvoice coming out of that mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.94,0:13:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bit of both, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I'm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.84,0:13:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.92,0:13:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three years ago, I was in need of a host,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.62,0:13:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and when I found you, I\Nused you to store my data.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.30,0:13:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you and I became as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.48,0:13:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.80,0:13:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was just about the\Ntime my friend Hiroki died.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:14:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Hiroki, the friend over\Nwhom you pretended to grieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you secretly hated him, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.86,0:14:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hated him because the two of you had\Npromised to go to the digital world together,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he left you all\Nalone. That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.28,0:14:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could never have hated Hiroki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.04,0:14:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you not remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Hiroki, can you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.72,0:14:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the digital world we were\Nsupposed to visit together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.20,0:14:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.20,0:14:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you have to do it, Hiroki?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.26,0:14:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you have to\Ndie and leave me alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.86,0:14:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you do this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.06,0:14:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.14,0:14:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to leave this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.56,0:14:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really want to\Ngo to the digital world?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.04,0:14:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.82,0:14:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.84,0:14:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you really want to\Ngo to the digital world,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.46,0:15:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soothe your heart with darkness,\Nand I'll take you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.68,0:15:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.04,0:15:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.14,0:15:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just take me there, please. So be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.52,0:15:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.44,0:15:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.62,0:15:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been inside of me controlling\Neverything I did. I do so love ironing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.24,0:15:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My little marionette, that voice, what I\Nstill hear that voice in my nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.46,0:15:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how can that be? Yes, I'm\Nnot surprised that you saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.16,0:15:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,through me my old pet but But\Nhere's something you didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.38,0:15:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dark Spirals were based\Non your own beloved tail ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.44,0:15:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so in a way, you caused\Nthose Digimon to be enslaved.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.72,0:15:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have known that only your twisted
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.78,0:15:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mind could come up with\Na plan as evil as this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.78,0:15:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it takes my nine\Nlives, I'll destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.50,0:15:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Delightful, but you're so very misguided.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.70,0:16:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's the matter are you\Nseeing double oh sorry got oman
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.18,0:16:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,got your tongue oh and by\Nthe way about the dark spores
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,opening a doorway between the\Nworlds they're really just
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.32,0:16:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the batteries that that will\Nallow me to finally be reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.30,0:16:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ew!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.46,0:16:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't worry, I\Nwon't destroy you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.80,0:16:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I first need to harvest the dark\Nflowers growing inside of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.06,0:16:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't count on that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.10,0:16:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.56,0:16:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.47,0:16:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.39,0:16:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.30,0:16:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spider Thread!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.70,0:16:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This dark flower had rose beef,\Nthis dark flower had none,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.76,0:16:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and this dark flower\Ncried whee-wee-wee-wee!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.64,0:16:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really getting on my nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.30,0:16:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now, let him eat in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.28,0:16:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And last, but not least,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.74,0:16:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,allow me to reveal myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.12,0:17:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.16,0:17:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's changing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.44,0:17:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But into Myotismon or Venom Myotismon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.94,0:17:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, you can call me Malomyotismon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.64,0:17:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing but a deadly,\Nblood-sucking fiend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.64,0:17:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing is as evil as Malomyotismon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.58,0:17:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been your faithful servant, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.22,0:17:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think I'm doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.54,0:17:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.24,0:17:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.76,0:17:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.72,0:17:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Archnemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.30,0:17:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you done to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.14,0:17:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just did what she was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.78,0:17:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now really, is that so wrong? Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.84,0:17:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.75,0:17:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just because I was thinking it doesn't\Nmean I really want it to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.26,0:17:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.64,0:17:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So tell me, what do you\Nthink I'm going to do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.08,0:17:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think hard now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.00,0:17:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.98,0:17:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.80,0:17:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.40,0:17:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's a tasty idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.82,0:18:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, get him on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.60,0:18:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.80,0:18:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What next?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.06,0:18:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.34,0:18:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me what you fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.22,0:18:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, no. No! Not that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.72,0:18:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.68,0:18:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you killing one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.72,0:18:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid she's gone to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.84,0:18:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I did was grant her her wish to\Nget as far away from me as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.40,0:18:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, she'll never be near me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.62,0:18:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You destroyed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.22,0:18:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.80,0:18:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snake Bandage!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.36,0:18:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't hide your fears, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.22,0:18:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you don't stand\Na chance against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.38,0:18:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.29,0:18:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.54,0:18:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've taken away my Archnemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.72,0:18:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now I'm going to make you\Npay for what you did to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.56,0:18:54.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.47,0:18:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you plan to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.39,0:18:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrap me in another useless snake bandage?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.58,0:19:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You scare me even less than these\NDigidestined fools from the other world!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.32,0:19:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I will teach you to fear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.32,0:19:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Playtime is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.64,0:19:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crimson Mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.24,0:19:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, time to digivolve.\NYou can't. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.00,0:19:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys, it's up to us to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.32,0:19:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never felt like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.12,0:19:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been so afraid to fight before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.68,0:19:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can someone else fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.40,0:19:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone else, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.44,0:19:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.68,0:19:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon I'll wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.90,0:19:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.52,0:19:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we think we can't win, then all\Nof us are doomed from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.36,0:19:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll win, but we've got to\Nbelieve in ourselves. He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.24,0:19:48.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.15,0:19:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fight him all by myself, Davis. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.86,0:19:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you can't fight alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.40,0:19:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.52,0:19:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'm going to lose, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.26,0:19:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.12,0:19:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.18,0:20:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to believe\Nthat we can defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.98,0:20:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, let's fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.88,0:20:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just imagine it's the last minute of a\Nsoccer game and it's you against the goalie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.64,0:20:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.66,0:20:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a clue!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.88,0:20:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beat the bad guy! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.04,0:20:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't look so tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.92,0:20:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.83,0:20:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Melomyotismon is too\Npowerful for XVmon alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.76,0:20:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to DNA digivolve,\Nright? Your hand. It's shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.60,0:20:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't help it. I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.28,0:20:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we'll never be able to DNA\Ndigivolve if you're afraid of it, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.56,0:20:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I've got a bad guy to beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.08,0:20:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.46,0:20:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, don't say another word, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.52,0:20:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that you're afraid,\Nbut you can't give in to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.14,0:20:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't let fear control you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.42,0:20:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to hide our fears from\NMyotismon, or he'll use them against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:20:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.28,0:21:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get him, XP-mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.12,0:21:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will win!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.28,0:21:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must defeat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.20,0:21:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.09,0:21:31.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Asu e mukau kisha wa togireta reeru de
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.54,0:21:37.60,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.28,0:21:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be wrong.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.02,0:21:45.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Te to te tsunagi awase issho ni hashiru to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.28,0:21:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're with your hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.28,0:21:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll be running together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you want a big power?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:52.75,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sou ookina chikara ga daseru no wa naze?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.16,0:22:03.17,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo tsuuji atteru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.28,0:22:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time, every time, we're connected.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.17,0:22:09.61,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo doko demo tonde ikeru wa
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.18,0:22:17.10,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo minna ga soba ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.10,0:22:24.44,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kitto kitto dare demo hitori janai wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.54,0:22:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.45,0:22:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.48,0:22:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.64,0:23:00.69,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\fscx115\fscy115\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(322,320)}The Last Armor Evolution
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.62,0:23:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be back.

